1
00:00:12,712 --> 00:00:14,647
We'll perform precoagulation
with radio frequency ablation

2
00:00:14,714 --> 00:00:15,782
on the hepatectomy line.

3
00:00:17,117 --> 00:00:18,184
Changing things again?

4
00:00:18,251 --> 00:00:20,487
Get the radio frequency
ablation system ready.

5
00:00:21,421 --> 00:00:23,823
She chooses the best method in an instant.

6
00:00:24,824 --> 00:00:27,260
Her instincts are like a wild animal's.

7
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:32,499
The surgery room isn't a jungle.
You don't need instincts like that.

8
00:00:32,565 --> 00:00:35,635
- You're exactly right, sir.
- Take a look.

9
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:42,842
At the poor lamb being
thrown around by the savage beast.

10
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:46,179
Dr. Daimon, the radio frequency
ablation system is ready.

11
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,381
Radio frequency needle.

12
00:00:52,652 --> 00:00:56,756
- We're doing another operation later.
- We need to adjust the schedule.

13
00:00:56,823 --> 00:00:59,893
- Let's get it over with.
- We've done three this morning.

14
00:00:59,959 --> 00:01:03,263
- I operate quickly.
- You must be kidding me.

15
00:01:03,329 --> 00:01:07,000
- We won't have time to eat lunch.
- I eat quickly too.

16
00:01:07,067 --> 00:01:08,001
Please stop.

17
00:01:09,269 --> 00:01:13,440
Unbelievable.
My Aya's run into trouble again.

18
00:01:14,507 --> 00:01:19,512
Hold on a second, Dr. Dangozaka.
Did you just say "my" Aya?

19
00:01:20,647 --> 00:01:25,618
What? Dr. Kaji, you like Aya too?

20
00:01:26,052 --> 00:01:27,353
No.

21
00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:34,260
If I had to choose one,
I go for Yuko. She's small and cute.

22
00:01:34,327 --> 00:01:37,831
I totally go for Mayumi. So charming.

23
00:01:39,232 --> 00:01:40,300
Don't push the button.

24
00:01:43,603 --> 00:01:46,606
- Why'd you press the button?
- How clumsy.

25
00:01:48,675 --> 00:01:49,776
Shogun's Harem Supervisor.

26
00:01:51,177 --> 00:01:52,679
I can't bear to listen.

27
00:01:56,216 --> 00:01:58,318
What do you think nurses are?

28
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,820
I'm terribly sorry.

29
00:02:00,887 --> 00:02:03,389
We'll close the incision.
3-0 nylon please.

30
00:02:03,456 --> 00:02:07,227
Men are the same at every hospital.

31
00:02:07,961 --> 00:02:11,197
This is a story about
a lone wolf woman doctor.

32
00:02:11,798 --> 00:02:17,837
Recently, some of the
doctors' actions are unpardonable.

33
00:02:19,038 --> 00:02:20,140
What do you mean?

34
00:02:20,573 --> 00:02:24,978
Anyone would agree our hospital has
the most brilliant minds in Japan.

35
00:02:25,044 --> 00:02:27,447
I believe that
the doctors, nurses, and staff

36
00:02:27,514 --> 00:02:31,718
should have the strongest
sense of ethics in Japan.

37
00:02:32,785 --> 00:02:34,354
However...

38
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:40,126
Happy birthday.
This is a scarf from Hermes.

39
00:02:41,594 --> 00:02:45,331
My birthday's in May.

40
00:02:47,867 --> 00:02:51,504
Though there's only one birth-month,
there are 12 birth-dates in a year.

41
00:02:52,472 --> 00:02:55,041
For your birthday next month,
let's go to dinner.

42
00:02:55,108 --> 00:02:57,544
You're gross. It's like
a monthly death anniversary.

43
00:02:57,610 --> 00:03:00,413
We could go to Chinatown
and eat Chinese food.

44
00:03:00,747 --> 00:03:03,550
I found a really good
sushi place in the Ginza area.

45
00:03:03,616 --> 00:03:05,785
I don't like to wait.

46
00:03:05,852 --> 00:03:09,822
You can change up the order
of when people get surgery, right?

47
00:03:09,889 --> 00:03:16,763
I'm really not supposed to accept gifts.

48
00:03:22,335 --> 00:03:24,037
Thank you.

49
00:03:24,103 --> 00:03:27,674
Among them, the worst is Dr. Daimon.

50
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:29,242
Dr. Daimon?

51
00:03:29,309 --> 00:03:32,745
She ignores the nurse's shift
and performs several surgeries.

52
00:03:32,812 --> 00:03:36,049
Some nurses can't take the hard labor
and move back to their hometown.

53
00:03:36,816 --> 00:03:39,085
This is power harassment by the doctor.

54
00:03:39,485 --> 00:03:44,123
It cannot be forgiven.
A loss of ethics is a loss of order.

55
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:48,027
Please strictly enforce
regulatory compliance immediately.

56
00:03:48,661 --> 00:03:52,799
I understand. I'll work on it immediately.

57
00:03:54,767 --> 00:03:56,035
Hold on.

58
00:04:02,141 --> 00:04:04,811
The president of
the Japan Nurse's Federation,

59
00:04:04,877 --> 00:04:07,013
Ms. Masae Mihara, has arrived.

60
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:14,520
Quite a nice room, Dr. Tendo.

61
00:04:15,121 --> 00:04:17,890
It has been a long time, ma'am.

62
00:04:17,957 --> 00:04:21,794
"You will one day become
a ruler of a kingdom."

63
00:04:23,663 --> 00:04:26,199
My prediction was right.

64
00:04:29,068 --> 00:04:30,169
Ms. Shiraki.

65
00:04:33,172 --> 00:04:37,944
Your look has become fitting
for the head nurse of this hospital.

66
00:04:38,544 --> 00:04:39,846
I'm not worthy of such praise.

67
00:04:42,181 --> 00:04:47,453
So President Mihara,
what did you come here for today?

68
00:04:48,488 --> 00:04:52,158
Before you start enforcing the
rules, I want you to do me a favor.

69
00:04:54,294 --> 00:04:59,399
<i>In 2014, medical establishments</i>
<i>collapsed and became more corrupt.</i>

70
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,403
<i>The field of medicine,</i>
<i>which deals with people's lives,</i>

71
00:05:03,469 --> 00:05:06,906
<i>had strayed away from what it should be.</i>

72
00:05:08,207 --> 00:05:10,910
<i>However, despite these conditions,</i>
<i>Japan announced to export</i>

73
00:05:10,977 --> 00:05:17,717
<i>state of the art medical services</i>
<i>as a growth strategy.</i>

74
00:05:17,784 --> 00:05:18,751
Ikawa.

75
00:05:20,086 --> 00:05:21,954
Take this to the surgical department.

76
00:05:22,689 --> 00:05:23,523
Yes, sir.

77
00:05:29,762 --> 00:05:30,930
<i>The world of medicine</i>

78
00:05:30,997 --> 00:05:34,200
<i>entered another era</i>
<i>following the law of jungle.</i>

79
00:05:35,635 --> 00:05:36,936
I feel it.

80
00:05:41,607 --> 00:05:43,876
Huh? That was...

81
00:05:44,277 --> 00:05:46,813
She outdid the Japan Medical Association

82
00:05:47,714 --> 00:05:49,682
and raised the status of nurses.

83
00:05:49,749 --> 00:05:52,352
She's the legendary nurse, Masae Mihara.

84
00:05:53,419 --> 00:05:54,654
Wow.

85
00:05:55,254 --> 00:05:57,724
<i>A brave woman who leads</i>
<i>the nurse's organization</i>

86
00:05:57,790 --> 00:06:00,226
<i>known as the shogun's harem.</i>
<i>She's also known as...</i>

87
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:04,630
<i>Lady Kasuga of the 21st century.</i>

88
00:06:06,466 --> 00:06:11,037
<i>Doctors who don't belong to</i>
<i>any medical offices appeared.</i>

89
00:06:11,104 --> 00:06:14,540
<i>Freelance doctors, in other words,</i>
<i>maverick doctors.</i>

90
00:06:15,908 --> 00:06:18,244
<i>For example, this woman.</i>

91
00:06:18,678 --> 00:06:22,281
<i>She despises teams, authority</i>
<i>and the restraints they bring.</i>

92
00:06:22,849 --> 00:06:27,620
<i>Her license and the skills she has</i>
<i>earned are her only weapons.</i>

93
00:06:28,554 --> 00:06:31,824
- You don't hold back in baring it.
- Bare what?

94
00:06:31,891 --> 00:06:35,928
- Too much.
- That hurts.

95
00:06:40,032 --> 00:06:43,302
How dare a nurse try to
spread so much charm.

96
00:06:43,903 --> 00:06:46,839
Ms. Shiraki, what's going on
with the nurse's training here?

97
00:06:48,007 --> 00:06:50,977
I'm a surgeon. A freelancer.

98
00:06:51,043 --> 00:06:52,412
- A doctor?
- Yes.

99
00:06:53,579 --> 00:06:55,515
Then this is even more inappropriate.

100
00:06:56,015 --> 00:06:58,684
How undisciplined. Get changed now.

101
00:07:00,253 --> 00:07:01,554
I won't do that.

102
00:07:07,059 --> 00:07:08,227
I'm terribly sorry.

103
00:07:11,230 --> 00:07:13,065
I'm terribly sorry.

104
00:07:13,132 --> 00:07:18,905
<i>Surgeon Michiko Daimon,</i>
<i>also known as Doctor-X.</i>

105
00:07:47,767 --> 00:07:50,403
Good morning.

106
00:07:55,274 --> 00:07:58,611
We'll now begin this week's
preoperative conference.

107
00:07:58,678 --> 00:08:01,080
The first case is not
a patient that was scheduled.

108
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:04,851
- But we'll prioritize this patient.
- Cutting in line?

109
00:08:04,917 --> 00:08:07,954
Ms. Nanako Mihara, a 25-year-old female.

110
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:10,022
The diagnosis is cervical cancer.

111
00:08:11,023 --> 00:08:15,194
A pelvic CT scan showed
a tumor over 5cm in the cervix.

112
00:08:16,028 --> 00:08:21,400
The tumor has infiltrated
the vaginal wall and parametrium.

113
00:08:22,802 --> 00:08:26,839
I'd like to add one thing
from the secretariat.

114
00:08:27,273 --> 00:08:30,243
Some of you might already know
about this special patient.

115
00:08:31,344 --> 00:08:34,614
She's the granddaughter of

116
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:38,184
the current Japan Nurse's Federation
president, Ms. Masae Mihara.

117
00:08:40,786 --> 00:08:43,456
I'd like to add one thing as well.

118
00:08:44,223 --> 00:08:49,161
President Mihara contributed
greatly to nursing in Japan.

119
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:54,567
Please make sure everything
goes without any problems.

120
00:08:55,001 --> 00:08:56,569
Please.

121
00:08:58,504 --> 00:09:01,440
The granddaughter of the nurses' boss.

122
00:09:02,642 --> 00:09:04,277
A great opportunity.

123
00:09:04,710 --> 00:09:07,013
We need to get
this operation no matter what.

124
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:09,482
I'll perform pelvic exenteration.

125
00:09:11,484 --> 00:09:13,286
She's butting in again.

126
00:09:13,986 --> 00:09:17,523
You're going to remove
all the viscera in the pelvis?

127
00:09:18,824 --> 00:09:20,793
- Yes.
- I object.

128
00:09:23,329 --> 00:09:28,367
Patient would need a double stoma
of a colostomy and urostomy.

129
00:09:28,935 --> 00:09:32,038
The standard procedure would be
an extended hysterectomy.

130
00:09:32,638 --> 00:09:34,840
Remove the uterus
along with the parametrium,

131
00:09:35,408 --> 00:09:36,709
preserve the other viscera.

132
00:09:37,310 --> 00:09:42,148
Postoperative chemotherapy and
radiation therapy is the choice.

133
00:09:42,214 --> 00:09:43,649
He's going for this operation.

134
00:09:44,150 --> 00:09:45,851
He's become quite skilled.

135
00:09:45,918 --> 00:09:49,221
Retaining the other viscera
leaves the risk of recurrence.

136
00:09:49,889 --> 00:09:53,326
In her current condition,
a recurrence is highly unlikely...

137
00:09:53,392 --> 00:09:54,927
"Highly" is not "zero."

138
00:09:56,829 --> 00:09:58,598
The best choice is pelvic exenteration

139
00:09:58,664 --> 00:10:00,666
as it can completely remove the cancer.

140
00:10:01,467 --> 00:10:06,072
Neither the patient nor her family
wish for pelvic exenteration.

141
00:10:07,974 --> 00:10:09,875
Quality of life.

142
00:10:10,343 --> 00:10:13,012
This is a decision based on
the difficulties after surgery.

143
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,315
Dr. Daimon,

144
00:10:16,382 --> 00:10:22,755
doctors must be
thoughtful and compassionate beings.

145
00:10:23,322 --> 00:10:24,890
Towards the patient.

146
00:10:25,691 --> 00:10:28,761
And towards the nurses
they work with as well.

147
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:40,573
Dr. Ashigara, are you confident that
you can succeed in this operation?

148
00:10:41,273 --> 00:10:42,108
Yes.

149
00:10:42,541 --> 00:10:44,076
I'll respect the patient's wish,

150
00:10:44,143 --> 00:10:48,080
and provide the best medical care
that's thoughtful and compassionate.

151
00:10:48,581 --> 00:10:53,085
Then I'll have you be the surgeon.

152
00:10:55,421 --> 00:10:56,288
Yes, sir.

153
00:10:57,289 --> 00:11:00,526
Compassion. The east has got this.

154
00:11:00,593 --> 00:11:02,061
Well done, Ashigara.

155
00:11:02,128 --> 00:11:04,330
An unexpected ambush got us.

156
00:11:04,397 --> 00:11:06,499
You idiot. Do some work.

157
00:11:13,406 --> 00:11:18,310
Dr. Ashigara, we nurses
will give you our full support.

158
00:11:18,644 --> 00:11:22,314
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

159
00:11:24,316 --> 00:11:25,384
Yes, ma'am.

160
00:11:27,853 --> 00:11:31,590
There's the shogun's harem. Scary.

161
00:11:35,261 --> 00:11:37,763
The east got the surgery.
I have no complaints.

162
00:11:37,830 --> 00:11:42,001
But there's something I can't understand.

163
00:11:43,035 --> 00:11:44,303
Same with me.

164
00:11:46,072 --> 00:11:48,841
Why? Why is it Ashigara?

165
00:11:50,710 --> 00:11:53,112
Ashigara is not dirty like us.

166
00:11:54,146 --> 00:11:57,283
He doesn't fool around
with patients or nurses,

167
00:11:57,349 --> 00:11:58,951
and doesn't accept gifts either.

168
00:11:59,418 --> 00:12:01,687
He's one of
the best husbands in this hospital.

169
00:12:02,488 --> 00:12:06,759
I don't know about his technique,
but he has great ethics as a doctor.

170
00:12:06,826 --> 00:12:10,262
I'm afraid that's the only thing
that got him chosen.

171
00:12:12,398 --> 00:12:16,102
- That's the reason?
- It's the only answer I can come up with.

172
00:12:19,004 --> 00:12:21,240
I found the answer.

173
00:12:22,274 --> 00:12:23,209
What's this?

174
00:12:23,275 --> 00:12:26,312
It's the popularity ranking of doctors
polled from nurses and patients.

175
00:12:26,378 --> 00:12:28,147
Ashigara is number one?

176
00:12:28,214 --> 00:12:33,452
His clean image is well-supported
by women of all age groups.

177
00:12:34,487 --> 00:12:37,723
By the way, I'm number 37

178
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:39,692
and Dr. Kaji is number 38.

179
00:12:40,025 --> 00:12:42,194
- I won.
- How stupid.

180
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:47,133
- Yes, so Ashigara...
- Don't be stupid.

181
00:12:47,199 --> 00:12:51,036
There are no clean doctors.
He just changes his filters.

182
00:12:53,105 --> 00:12:59,078
The west must get the surgery
for that granddaughter.

183
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:04,049
Listen. If you nose around, you'll
find something on him for sure.

184
00:13:04,583 --> 00:13:05,618
Search.

185
00:13:06,252 --> 00:13:07,186
Yes, sir.

186
00:13:08,587 --> 00:13:13,859
But why are Dr. Ebina
and I fighting for last place?

187
00:13:13,926 --> 00:13:15,828
- That's not right.
- Yeah, sure.

188
00:13:15,895 --> 00:13:19,031
- How did it end up like this?
- He doesn't understand.

189
00:13:21,367 --> 00:13:23,169
NANAKO MIHARA MASAE'S GRANDDAUGHTER

190
00:13:23,869 --> 00:13:26,906
I'm Ashigara, the surgeon in charge.
Nice to meet you.

191
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:30,442
I'm Kaji. I'll be the assistant.

192
00:13:30,876 --> 00:13:32,711
I'm Daimon, the second assistant.

193
00:13:33,612 --> 00:13:34,580
Compassion.

194
00:13:34,647 --> 00:13:38,717
We have told
President Tendo of our requests.

195
00:13:38,784 --> 00:13:42,955
As you requested, we'll
preserve the viscera in the pelvis

196
00:13:43,022 --> 00:13:44,390
and remove the tumor.

197
00:13:44,957 --> 00:13:48,327
We'll perform postoperative
chemotherapy and radiation therapy,

198
00:13:48,394 --> 00:13:51,030
it'll not affect your daily life.
Please rest assured.

199
00:13:51,564 --> 00:13:54,633
You can also get a complete cure
through a pelvic exenteration.

200
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:56,702
I didn't ask the second assistant.

201
00:13:58,103 --> 00:14:02,241
Dr. Ashigara,
please take good care of her.

202
00:14:09,348 --> 00:14:10,249
Yes?

203
00:14:10,816 --> 00:14:11,917
Nothing.

204
00:14:11,984 --> 00:14:15,421
Dr. Ashigara is the
No. 1 gentleman of this hospital.

205
00:14:16,088 --> 00:14:19,491
Isn't it great that
you got a good doctor, Nanako?

206
00:14:21,594 --> 00:14:25,331
- Are you married, Dr. Ashigara?
- Yes?

207
00:14:28,934 --> 00:14:30,402
Oh, yes.

208
00:14:30,469 --> 00:14:34,073
Your wife must be very happy
to have someone like you.

209
00:14:34,139 --> 00:14:35,007
Really?

210
00:14:35,074 --> 00:14:36,108
Daimon.

211
00:14:37,843 --> 00:14:38,978
What a shame.

212
00:14:40,079 --> 00:14:41,013
Really?

213
00:14:41,847 --> 00:14:42,848
Daimon.

214
00:14:47,386 --> 00:14:51,423
- This isn't anything great.
- No, I can't accept things like this.

215
00:14:51,490 --> 00:14:55,527
It's really nothing big.
Please eat it with your colleagues.

216
00:14:55,594 --> 00:14:57,096
I can't.

217
00:14:57,162 --> 00:15:03,469
Listen to President Mihara
and gratefully receive the gift.

218
00:15:03,535 --> 00:15:04,503
Yes, but...

219
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:07,539
Dr. Ashigara is foolishly honest.

220
00:15:08,340 --> 00:15:10,409
You must consider
the feelings of the patients

221
00:15:10,476 --> 00:15:11,744
who give you the gift.

222
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:15,514
- I understand.
- Really?

223
00:15:15,915 --> 00:15:16,782
Daimon.

224
00:15:18,584 --> 00:15:19,785
Thank you.

225
00:15:21,487 --> 00:15:23,489
I'll be leaving now.

226
00:15:25,491 --> 00:15:26,825
Excuse me.

227
00:15:30,095 --> 00:15:31,063
Daimon.

228
00:15:40,873 --> 00:15:42,441
Thanks for choosing me.

229
00:15:42,975 --> 00:15:46,512
- I really am thankful.
- Please don't say that.

230
00:15:55,587 --> 00:15:57,256
Chestnut "yokan" jelly.

231
00:15:59,925 --> 00:16:00,926
There it is.

232
00:16:09,768 --> 00:16:12,604
- It's thick.
- I didn't expect this.

233
00:16:21,246 --> 00:16:22,614
"Be careful."

234
00:16:27,553 --> 00:16:28,387
A trap?

235
00:16:29,388 --> 00:16:30,255
It's a trap.

236
00:16:32,124 --> 00:16:34,560
I'm going out to lunch.

237
00:16:36,095 --> 00:16:37,296
I'm taking this.

238
00:16:38,964 --> 00:16:40,799
How old-fashioned.

239
00:16:48,207 --> 00:16:52,378
Skimpy clothes and a brash attitude.
How disgraceful.

240
00:16:52,878 --> 00:16:57,249
I heard you suggested a pelvic
exenteration at the conference.

241
00:16:57,683 --> 00:16:58,550
Yes.

242
00:16:59,385 --> 00:17:01,720
"Talents: surgery. Hobbies: surgery."

243
00:17:03,355 --> 00:17:04,623
What a joke.

244
00:17:09,395 --> 00:17:12,531
You think you're talented, right?

245
00:17:15,067 --> 00:17:20,439
People like that think
their diagnosis is the best.

246
00:17:21,974 --> 00:17:25,411
They look down on others and expect
others to obey since they're talented.

247
00:17:27,846 --> 00:17:31,050
If she doesn't get a pelvic exenteration,
she won't heal completely.

248
00:17:31,116 --> 00:17:33,419
My granddaughter is still 25.

249
00:17:35,020 --> 00:17:37,689
This is about human dignity.

250
00:17:38,657 --> 00:17:42,227
If she gets a pelvic exenteration,
she'll have trouble urinating.

251
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:47,066
- She'll lose her functions as a woman too.
- Defecate and urinate?

252
00:17:48,434 --> 00:17:51,270
I'm eating right now.

253
00:17:54,306 --> 00:17:57,176
I'll protect my dignity of eating.

254
00:18:08,487 --> 00:18:09,688
Wait there, Ms. Daimon.

255
00:18:11,590 --> 00:18:13,125
Remember what I told you?

256
00:18:14,326 --> 00:18:17,763
A super doctor like you
is the biggest nuisance.

257
00:18:20,432 --> 00:18:24,336
You didn't even try to
think about what I meant.

258
00:18:24,403 --> 00:18:25,604
That hurt.

259
00:18:25,671 --> 00:18:28,507
Nor did you try to understand.

260
00:18:29,274 --> 00:18:30,909
You don't even try to recognize it.

261
00:18:32,311 --> 00:18:33,245
Want to eat this?

262
00:18:33,312 --> 00:18:36,482
Did you think it was just
some nonsense some nurse said?

263
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:41,120
- If so...
- If so?

264
00:18:41,487 --> 00:18:43,088
Not in a hundred years.

265
00:18:50,329 --> 00:18:54,700
I'll personally protect Miss Nanako.

266
00:18:55,367 --> 00:18:58,604
I won't let that woman
lay one finger on her.

267
00:18:59,338 --> 00:19:03,275
Ms. Shiraki, well said.

268
00:19:04,610 --> 00:19:08,013
- I'm counting on you.
- Yes ma'am.

269
00:19:10,082 --> 00:19:12,117
Is this a historical drama?

270
00:19:13,785 --> 00:19:15,154
Unbelievable.

271
00:19:19,057 --> 00:19:20,325
Michiko, are you serious?

272
00:19:20,392 --> 00:19:23,996
She said not in a hundred years.
But I'm not that old... Ouch.

273
00:19:24,463 --> 00:19:26,565
You've done something terrible.

274
00:19:26,632 --> 00:19:29,234
- That's not good.
- Why?

275
00:19:29,301 --> 00:19:31,737
Aren't you aware of
the power of the shogun's harem?

276
00:19:31,803 --> 00:19:35,741
It's amazing you're still a doctor.
It's a miracle.

277
00:19:35,807 --> 00:19:39,311
If the shogun's harem thinks badly
of you, a doctor is finished.

278
00:19:39,378 --> 00:19:40,546
Why?

279
00:19:40,612 --> 00:19:42,748
The shogun's harem's power is infinite.

280
00:19:42,814 --> 00:19:45,751
They control the order of exams, surgeries
and operation rooms.

281
00:19:45,817 --> 00:19:48,754
They have far more power
than the secretariat in a hospital.

282
00:19:50,422 --> 00:19:53,458
- Really?
- That's not all.

283
00:19:53,525 --> 00:19:55,661
Behind the closed doors
of the surgery room,

284
00:19:55,727 --> 00:19:59,298
secrets about nurses and doctors
that can' be revealed are abounding.

285
00:19:59,364 --> 00:20:00,165
What secrets?

286
00:20:00,232 --> 00:20:03,268
Various mistakes that
the doctor made during surgery.

287
00:20:03,335 --> 00:20:05,337
From medical mistakes to misjudgments.

288
00:20:05,404 --> 00:20:09,074
The nurses know about
every mistake doctors make.

289
00:20:09,141 --> 00:20:11,843
This was a gift from Dr. Kaji.

290
00:20:11,910 --> 00:20:13,879
- A scarf from Hermes?
- Yeah.

291
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:17,382
Does he think he's winning
my favor with this?

292
00:20:17,449 --> 00:20:20,686
Hey, don't you have
any good secrets lately?

293
00:20:20,752 --> 00:20:22,321
One worth a few new handbags.

294
00:20:23,589 --> 00:20:27,192
Oh yeah, Dr. Ashigara...

295
00:20:27,259 --> 00:20:28,994
"Mr. Clean"?

296
00:20:29,061 --> 00:20:32,497
- Have you heard this story?
- Let me hear it.

297
00:20:35,734 --> 00:20:38,737
Nurses who know about
your intern days are the worst.

298
00:20:39,071 --> 00:20:43,342
If secrets from the past are
revealed, a doctor is done for.

299
00:20:43,408 --> 00:20:47,813
That's why doctors keep the nurses happy,

300
00:20:47,879 --> 00:20:52,117
and work hard to use
connections and collect information.

301
00:20:54,052 --> 00:20:57,356
- Delicious.
- A scarf? How stupid.

302
00:20:57,422 --> 00:21:01,059
It's an oriental-style Hermes.
I spent a lot of money on it.

303
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:03,595
It'll be good insurance
if something happens.

304
00:21:03,662 --> 00:21:05,030
That's wishful thinking.

305
00:21:05,831 --> 00:21:08,767
You worked in the countryside too long.

306
00:21:09,835 --> 00:21:11,570
You're not spending enough.

307
00:21:13,105 --> 00:21:14,106
Really?

308
00:21:14,172 --> 00:21:17,909
She's a nurse of the National
Advanced Medical Care Center.

309
00:21:18,243 --> 00:21:20,078
They're costly.

310
00:21:20,145 --> 00:21:22,648
You could say that doctors' futures

311
00:21:22,714 --> 00:21:25,384
rest upon how well you win
the favor of nurses every day.

312
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:30,389
You must be extremely careful about gifts.

313
00:21:30,455 --> 00:21:31,490
Exactly.

314
00:21:32,891 --> 00:21:33,792
Oh yeah.

315
00:21:34,693 --> 00:21:37,763
Dr. Ebina, there must be
some meaning to the fact that

316
00:21:37,829 --> 00:21:39,298
we sat next to each other.

317
00:21:39,965 --> 00:21:43,402
When you're dealing with the shogun's
harem, there's no east or west.

318
00:21:44,202 --> 00:21:47,806
When something goes wrong,
let's work together.

319
00:21:47,873 --> 00:21:50,409
- Of course.
- Thanks.

320
00:21:50,942 --> 00:21:55,747
Damn. I should've
given her a handbag. Ouch.

321
00:21:57,683 --> 00:21:58,717
Say my name?

322
00:21:58,784 --> 00:22:01,753
Men are so stupid.

323
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:06,958
I want an Hermes too.
I know lots of mistakes.

324
00:22:07,025 --> 00:22:08,393
I covered their mistakes.

325
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:11,530
- Not you, Michiko. Give up.
- No.

326
00:22:12,130 --> 00:22:13,398
Ron.

327
00:22:14,099 --> 00:22:16,101
Thirteen orphans.

328
00:22:17,936 --> 00:22:21,273
Oh no.

329
00:22:24,309 --> 00:22:26,878
- This is not good.
- What's wrong?

330
00:22:26,945 --> 00:22:29,114
Results from Nanako Mihara's
preoperative exam.

331
00:22:30,182 --> 00:22:31,216
This is...

332
00:22:31,717 --> 00:22:33,485
The tumor has infiltrated
the rectum and bladder.

333
00:22:33,985 --> 00:22:37,489
The cancer is more advanced than expected.
It's Stage IVa.

334
00:22:37,556 --> 00:22:39,524
Complete removal of the cancer

335
00:22:39,591 --> 00:22:41,827
while retaining
the pelvic viscera is impossible.

336
00:22:42,427 --> 00:22:44,096
It's a matter of how much time
she has left.

337
00:22:44,162 --> 00:22:48,333
The only way to save her life
is a pelvic exenteration.

338
00:22:49,167 --> 00:22:52,904
But neither the patient
nor President Mihara desire that.

339
00:22:55,240 --> 00:22:56,775
I won't share the results.

340
00:22:56,842 --> 00:22:58,543
I'll remove as much of the cancer
as I can.

341
00:22:59,177 --> 00:23:02,314
- Without sharing the results?
- It's to avoid psychological stress

342
00:23:02,381 --> 00:23:04,316
and not have the patient lose hope.

343
00:23:04,383 --> 00:23:06,151
But this is President Mihara.

344
00:23:06,952 --> 00:23:11,056
If she finds out,
we'll be enemies of the shogun's harem.

345
00:23:11,123 --> 00:23:13,458
If that happens,
forget about hope to live.

346
00:23:13,525 --> 00:23:15,360
Our futures as doctors will be lost.

347
00:23:16,061 --> 00:23:17,095
That's true.

348
00:23:18,430 --> 00:23:22,701
We must tell them the results
and let the patient decide for herself.

349
00:23:25,604 --> 00:23:31,443
So who'll put the bell around
the neck of the legendary nurse?

350
00:23:41,019 --> 00:23:44,689
A bell. How can I bell her?

351
00:23:47,592 --> 00:23:49,761
So it's spread this far.

352
00:23:50,228 --> 00:23:51,129
It's terrible.

353
00:23:51,463 --> 00:23:55,434
Both the proctoscope and cystoscope
showed infiltration to the tissue.

354
00:23:55,834 --> 00:23:58,203
- The surgery should be done right away.
- Yes.

355
00:23:59,337 --> 00:24:02,841
Dr. Daimon, I'm jealous of you.

356
00:24:03,542 --> 00:24:06,578
You can do business without thinking
about the patient's feelings.

357
00:24:08,980 --> 00:24:09,815
Huh?

358
00:24:11,850 --> 00:24:13,084
Dr. Daimon?

359
00:24:17,489 --> 00:24:20,158
Dr. Daimon, no.

360
00:24:20,225 --> 00:24:22,794
- You can't put the bell on her yet.
- Why not?

361
00:24:23,161 --> 00:24:26,031
You have to use connections
and collect information first.

362
00:24:26,097 --> 00:24:28,433
Forget connections
when there's a life on the line.

363
00:24:31,703 --> 00:24:33,138
Dr. Daimon.

364
00:24:39,878 --> 00:24:44,015
- Am I going to die?
- Yes.

365
00:24:45,350 --> 00:24:48,220
- Dr. Daimon.
- If you don't get a pelvic exenteration.

366
00:24:53,558 --> 00:24:55,794
I'll not allow that.

367
00:24:56,595 --> 00:24:59,631
I brought her here since this hospital is
supposed to be the best in Japan.

368
00:24:59,698 --> 00:25:03,301
Retain the viscera and
cure her no matter what.

369
00:25:03,368 --> 00:25:07,606
You were a nurse,
so you understand, right?

370
00:25:07,672 --> 00:25:09,074
I'm not talking to you.

371
00:25:10,475 --> 00:25:13,011
I'm asking Dr. Ashigara.

372
00:25:16,081 --> 00:25:17,649
You can do it, right?

373
00:25:21,953 --> 00:25:23,321
Grandmother, please stop.

374
00:25:24,556 --> 00:25:28,493
I trust Dr. Ashigara as my surgeon.

375
00:25:29,761 --> 00:25:31,930
What do you think, doctor?

376
00:25:38,470 --> 00:25:42,440
It's a choice between spending
the rest of your life

377
00:25:42,507 --> 00:25:44,876
without disabilities or with disabilities.

378
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:51,716
Even if you were to be disabled,

379
00:25:53,451 --> 00:25:55,253
I want you to live.

380
00:26:04,029 --> 00:26:07,232
I suggest pelvic exenteration.

381
00:26:07,299 --> 00:26:08,466
Quiet.

382
00:26:09,467 --> 00:26:14,105
You're going to take away
a woman's happiness from Nanako?

383
00:26:16,775 --> 00:26:17,909
I understand.

384
00:26:21,713 --> 00:26:24,583
I'll leave everything
to you, Dr. Ashigara.

385
00:26:26,051 --> 00:26:27,052
Nanako.

386
00:26:27,552 --> 00:26:31,489
I've been telling you
from the start. Exenteration.

387
00:26:46,471 --> 00:26:49,107
The key is to separate
the cardinal ligament area

388
00:26:49,507 --> 00:26:51,509
as close as possible to the rectum.

389
00:26:51,576 --> 00:26:55,046
Got it. I'll support
in the cardinal ligament area.

390
00:26:55,113 --> 00:26:56,881
- Yes.
- How stupid.

391
00:26:56,948 --> 00:26:58,917
I could cut the cardinal ligament area

392
00:26:58,984 --> 00:27:00,719
while preserving the autonomic nerve.

393
00:27:05,657 --> 00:27:08,627
We'll be in charge
of tomorrow's operation.

394
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:11,296
Dr. Daimon, you're not needed.

395
00:27:12,197 --> 00:27:15,166
I asked Dr. Daimon
to be the second assistant.

396
00:27:15,567 --> 00:27:17,636
This is a decision that I,
the surgeon, made.

397
00:27:18,837 --> 00:27:19,904
Please understand.

398
00:27:23,375 --> 00:27:25,977
If she'll be there,
there's nothing I can do.

399
00:27:26,978 --> 00:27:29,180
However, do not do anything.

400
00:27:32,217 --> 00:27:33,051
Understand?

401
00:27:37,989 --> 00:27:39,157
Answer me.

402
00:27:47,232 --> 00:27:49,834
It's 5 o'clock so I'm leaving.

403
00:28:00,378 --> 00:28:01,546
I'm hungry.

404
00:28:02,547 --> 00:28:04,616
Would you like some tea?

405
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:24,936
We'll now begin the pelvic exenteration.

406
00:28:25,270 --> 00:28:29,007
- Let's begin.
- Good luck.

407
00:28:29,441 --> 00:28:32,444
Vitals. Blood pressure 100,
pulse 80 and sinus.

408
00:28:34,012 --> 00:28:35,046
Scalpel.

409
00:28:44,756 --> 00:28:45,890
Monopolar.

410
00:28:47,525 --> 00:28:49,661
Dr. Ashigara is a talented doctor.

411
00:28:50,328 --> 00:28:51,463
There are no guarantees,

412
00:28:52,063 --> 00:28:55,333
but I believe he'll surely
overcome this obstacle.

413
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:59,370
I thought this hospital
would be able to do something.

414
00:29:01,072 --> 00:29:04,042
If it was going to end up like this,
I could've taken her somewhere else.

415
00:29:05,310 --> 00:29:08,379
We'll do our absolute best.

416
00:29:10,749 --> 00:29:12,817
Poor Nanako.

417
00:29:23,528 --> 00:29:25,697
Lymphadenectomy is complete.

418
00:29:26,131 --> 00:29:31,770
We'll now cut each ligament
and remove the uterus and ovary.

419
00:29:32,203 --> 00:29:33,338
Curved forceps.

420
00:29:34,072 --> 00:29:35,106
Tweezers.

421
00:29:47,051 --> 00:29:47,986
What's wrong?

422
00:29:55,059 --> 00:29:55,960
Sweat.

423
00:29:56,594 --> 00:29:57,562
What's wrong?

424
00:29:58,596 --> 00:29:59,798
Is something wrong?

425
00:30:04,068 --> 00:30:05,503
Abscess in the pouch of Douglas.

426
00:30:05,570 --> 00:30:08,573
The tumor has invaded the cardinal
ligament. There's adhesion.

427
00:30:09,007 --> 00:30:11,743
Forcing separation
will cause much blood loss.

428
00:30:13,344 --> 00:30:15,480
Her body temperature is above normal.

429
00:30:15,947 --> 00:30:18,817
The inflammation has spread.
Her overall condition is not good.

430
00:30:21,719 --> 00:30:23,655
Saline solution.

431
00:30:24,622 --> 00:30:28,326
The surgery shouldn't drag on.
Dr. Ashigara, please go on.

432
00:30:39,904 --> 00:30:40,872
Move.

433
00:30:41,973 --> 00:30:42,941
Move.

434
00:30:43,975 --> 00:30:45,343
The assistant must stay out.

435
00:30:46,978 --> 00:30:49,948
Even if I'm an assistant,
I don't make mistakes.

436
00:30:55,386 --> 00:30:56,621
I'm very sorry.

437
00:30:57,422 --> 00:30:58,256
I'm very sorry.

438
00:31:02,393 --> 00:31:03,661
Continue the exenteration.

439
00:31:03,728 --> 00:31:05,496
Assistant, clean the abscess.

440
00:31:05,563 --> 00:31:07,532
Yes. You're ordering me again.

441
00:31:07,599 --> 00:31:08,766
Metzenbaum.

442
00:31:30,054 --> 00:31:33,758
She's fast. Very fast.

443
00:31:42,433 --> 00:31:45,470
Cut 5cm from the cervix. Monopolar.

444
00:31:47,305 --> 00:31:48,139
Yes.

445
00:31:49,574 --> 00:31:50,675
Kelly forceps.

446
00:32:10,161 --> 00:32:11,896
Pelvic exenteration complete.

447
00:32:29,080 --> 00:32:30,081
How unfortunate.

448
00:32:31,883 --> 00:32:32,884
Please wait.

449
00:32:40,758 --> 00:32:43,962
We'll move on to
the colostomy and urostomy.

450
00:32:44,028 --> 00:32:45,029
I won't do that.

451
00:32:47,498 --> 00:32:48,666
What?

452
00:32:50,935 --> 00:32:54,973
She won't do that?
She's not doing a double stoma?

453
00:32:55,573 --> 00:32:57,875
What are you planning, Daimon?

454
00:33:06,784 --> 00:33:09,988
We'll move on to
the colostomy and urostomy.

455
00:33:10,054 --> 00:33:11,022
I won't do that.

456
00:33:13,558 --> 00:33:15,393
- What?
- She won't do that?

457
00:33:15,994 --> 00:33:17,795
She's not doing a double stoma?

458
00:33:18,196 --> 00:33:20,431
What are you planning, Daimon?

459
00:33:21,933 --> 00:33:23,835
We'll preserve the rectal sphincter,

460
00:33:23,901 --> 00:33:26,204
and perform substitute
bladder reconstruction.

461
00:33:26,270 --> 00:33:27,505
Reconstruction?

462
00:33:29,340 --> 00:33:30,508
What?

463
00:33:35,747 --> 00:33:38,549
We'll connect the preserved
rectal sphincter and colon

464
00:33:38,616 --> 00:33:40,084
to preserve anal functions.

465
00:33:40,151 --> 00:33:42,420
We'll create a bladder substitute
with the removed intestines,

466
00:33:42,487 --> 00:33:45,123
and rebuild the bladder by
connecting ureter and urethra to it.

467
00:33:46,391 --> 00:33:49,460
Surgeon, if you have
time to stand around, help.

468
00:33:50,128 --> 00:33:50,962
Yes.

469
00:33:51,496 --> 00:33:53,031
Supervisor, you too.

470
00:33:54,232 --> 00:33:55,900
- Yes.
- Changing things again?

471
00:33:55,967 --> 00:33:57,902
The anesthetist will shut up and do it.

472
00:33:58,436 --> 00:33:59,937
Damn. She yelled at me.

473
00:34:00,605 --> 00:34:04,675
Vitals, blood pressure 100, pulse 80,
body temperature 36 and stable.

474
00:34:04,742 --> 00:34:08,946
Got it. Subtotal resection
of the ileum now. Metzenbaum.

475
00:34:16,587 --> 00:34:19,023
Surgeon, increase the operating field.

476
00:34:19,090 --> 00:34:20,925
Yes. Retractor.

477
00:34:33,371 --> 00:34:37,475
So she won't need
an artificial anus or bladder?

478
00:34:38,042 --> 00:34:41,813
She completely removed the cancer
cells with a pelvic exenteration,

479
00:34:42,380 --> 00:34:44,882
and she can preserve
defecating and urinating functions?

480
00:35:14,445 --> 00:35:18,182
- Blood loss?
- 3,000cc. Vitals are normal.

481
00:35:18,783 --> 00:35:20,251
Preservation of the rectal sphincter

482
00:35:20,318 --> 00:35:22,887
and substitute bladder
reconstruction complete.

483
00:35:23,654 --> 00:35:26,357
Thank you.

484
00:35:34,732 --> 00:35:35,900
Dr. Daimon.

485
00:35:39,070 --> 00:35:40,138
Thank you very much.

486
00:35:55,987 --> 00:35:57,522
Wonderful.

487
00:35:57,955 --> 00:35:59,824
After surgery, your granddaughter

488
00:36:00,291 --> 00:36:04,996
will be able to lead
the life that you wished for.

489
00:36:37,562 --> 00:36:38,629
Dr. Daimon.

490
00:36:43,034 --> 00:36:44,502
You don't need to thank me.

491
00:36:48,239 --> 00:36:51,242
Don't think that something
like that will always be alright.

492
00:36:52,009 --> 00:36:52,977
Huh?

493
00:36:53,044 --> 00:36:56,814
Pushing aside the surgeon and
changing the operative method.

494
00:36:57,248 --> 00:36:59,383
It's far beyond the realm of a nuisance.

495
00:37:00,551 --> 00:37:01,852
Wall slam?

496
00:37:02,753 --> 00:37:04,755
Not in a thousand years.

497
00:37:12,163 --> 00:37:14,198
900 more years than last time.

498
00:37:17,168 --> 00:37:18,536
What a pain.

499
00:37:23,207 --> 00:37:25,910
In Japan, the number of nurses

500
00:37:26,611 --> 00:37:28,879
is far greater than the number of doctors.

501
00:37:29,413 --> 00:37:33,351
The labor costs are
about 4 times that of doctors'.

502
00:37:33,417 --> 00:37:39,557
Therefore, the nurse organization
must be cared for greatly.

503
00:37:40,124 --> 00:37:40,958
Yes.

504
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:45,630
You did great work this time.

505
00:37:46,731 --> 00:37:48,833
Thank you.

506
00:37:49,166 --> 00:37:50,801
We'll prepare a report immediately.

507
00:37:50,868 --> 00:37:52,737
- Ashigara, start working on it.
- Yes, sir.

508
00:37:52,803 --> 00:37:55,606
Who asked you for a case report?

509
00:37:57,275 --> 00:37:58,542
Dr. Ashigara,

510
00:37:59,377 --> 00:38:03,581
shouldn't you rather be
writing a letter of resignation?

511
00:38:06,183 --> 00:38:07,952
President Tendo, what do you mean?

512
00:38:08,019 --> 00:38:12,189
You panicked during the operation,
and abandoned the surgery.

513
00:38:13,324 --> 00:38:15,693
That is absolutely
unforgiveable as a doctor.

514
00:38:16,160 --> 00:38:17,328
Please wait.

515
00:38:17,395 --> 00:38:19,897
Dr. Ashigara is not a doctor
we can easily replace.

516
00:38:19,964 --> 00:38:22,266
He is impartial and
has a strong sense of ethics.

517
00:38:22,333 --> 00:38:26,237
"All those nights I spent with you,
I loved you.

518
00:38:27,038 --> 00:38:29,607
For every night together, I loved you.

519
00:38:29,674 --> 00:38:34,478
For every night to come, I will love you.

520
00:38:35,413 --> 00:38:37,581
I promise to divorce my wife.

521
00:38:38,082 --> 00:38:39,583
Please wait for me."

522
00:38:41,252 --> 00:38:44,789
- What's that?
- An email that Dr. Ashigara sent.

523
00:38:46,824 --> 00:38:48,426
To whom?

524
00:38:48,492 --> 00:38:53,497
It was sent to President Mihara's
granddaughter.

525
00:38:54,432 --> 00:38:55,900
Nanako.

526
00:38:58,969 --> 00:39:01,405
Are you serious, Mr. Clean?

527
00:39:04,041 --> 00:39:09,213
Dr. Ashigara,
you acted like a good husband,

528
00:39:09,280 --> 00:39:11,649
but committed the utmost unfaithfulness.

529
00:39:12,350 --> 00:39:19,056
Your actions greatly damage
this hospital's dignity.

530
00:39:21,592 --> 00:39:23,027
Understand?

531
00:39:29,100 --> 00:39:31,502
This is a pen.
This is a letter of resignation.

532
00:39:34,238 --> 00:39:37,274
Please sign it. With today's date.

533
00:39:49,053 --> 00:39:50,020
Dr. Ebina.

534
00:39:52,056 --> 00:39:55,526
We can't deny your
negligence of supervision.

535
00:40:04,702 --> 00:40:05,569
Open the door.

536
00:40:06,036 --> 00:40:07,104
- But...
- Open it.

537
00:40:07,171 --> 00:40:08,005
Yes.

538
00:40:15,379 --> 00:40:20,851
- What is all this commotion about?
- Did you leak the news about Dr. Ashigara?

539
00:40:21,619 --> 00:40:24,688
About that?

540
00:40:25,156 --> 00:40:26,357
I knew it.

541
00:40:27,057 --> 00:40:30,661
I found an interesting
email from Dr. Ashigara,

542
00:40:30,728 --> 00:40:33,731
so I presented it to the shogun's harem.

543
00:40:34,165 --> 00:40:36,066
Right after we made that promise.

544
00:40:36,133 --> 00:40:39,870
If you act well-mannered
in this hospital...

545
00:40:42,206 --> 00:40:43,841
You won't survive.

546
00:40:57,254 --> 00:40:58,889
I will thank you.

547
00:41:06,096 --> 00:41:08,165
For saving my granddaughter.

548
00:41:17,041 --> 00:41:18,242
You'll see your great-grandchild too.

549
00:41:21,011 --> 00:41:23,380
I cryopreserved the ovarian tissue.

550
00:41:24,381 --> 00:41:28,319
OVARIAN TISSUE CRYOPRESERVATION

551
00:41:32,890 --> 00:41:34,191
Cryopreserve this.

552
00:41:39,029 --> 00:41:42,233
Because you look like
you'll live a long life.

553
00:41:57,815 --> 00:42:00,184
I am so relieved.

554
00:42:00,651 --> 00:42:03,153
The staff at the National
Advanced Medical Care Center

555
00:42:03,220 --> 00:42:06,123
- send you our best regards.
- Thank you.

556
00:42:08,125 --> 00:42:10,561
- Hello.
- Again? Not now.

557
00:42:10,628 --> 00:42:11,862
Well.

558
00:42:12,229 --> 00:42:15,432
The president of the Japan
Nurse's Federation is here too.

559
00:42:16,500 --> 00:42:21,739
Thank you for using
our Daimon and Jonouchi.

560
00:42:22,740 --> 00:42:24,208
I'm terribly sorry.

561
00:42:26,810 --> 00:42:29,346
This is a melon. This is a bill.

562
00:42:29,747 --> 00:42:32,650
I will pay for this.

563
00:42:32,716 --> 00:42:34,251
I can't let you.

564
00:42:34,852 --> 00:42:36,520
It would a breach of contract

565
00:42:36,587 --> 00:42:39,256
to receive payment
directly from the patient.

566
00:42:40,457 --> 00:42:42,393
We get the surgery fees from the hospital,

567
00:42:42,459 --> 00:42:45,829
and from the patient,
we accept gratuities.

568
00:42:46,263 --> 00:42:50,467
By the way, we have
no maximum for gratuities.

569
00:42:51,969 --> 00:42:53,404
Here you are.

570
00:42:56,574 --> 00:42:57,775
I'm sorry.

571
00:42:58,475 --> 00:43:01,712
Twenty million yen?
What is this ridiculous price?

572
00:43:03,480 --> 00:43:07,217
We performed the surgery
in place of a lewd doctor

573
00:43:07,651 --> 00:43:10,154
who laid his hand on the
president's granddaughter.

574
00:43:11,221 --> 00:43:16,093
We also saved not only her life,
but ensured a healthy future.

575
00:43:16,160 --> 00:43:17,494
It's the price for that.

576
00:43:17,561 --> 00:43:21,966
I understand.
We'll wire you the money later.

577
00:43:22,032 --> 00:43:23,334
Thank you.

578
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:26,136
However, we can't accept the melon.

579
00:43:27,104 --> 00:43:30,441
Receiving gifts goes against
the regulatory compliance.

580
00:43:31,175 --> 00:43:33,877
- Please take it home.
- I see.

581
00:43:33,944 --> 00:43:40,150
I mean, you'll be receiving
something greater than a melon.

582
00:43:54,431 --> 00:43:58,168
That was just great.

583
00:43:58,235 --> 00:44:00,938
<i>She despises teams, authority</i>
<i>and the restraints they bring.</i>

584
00:44:01,005 --> 00:44:05,275
<i>Her license and the skills she has</i>
<i>earned are her only weapons.</i>

585
00:44:05,342 --> 00:44:07,911
So what happened to the melon?

586
00:44:07,978 --> 00:44:10,047
The chief of the secretariat took it.

587
00:44:10,114 --> 00:44:11,982
He said he loves melons.

588
00:44:12,049 --> 00:44:16,186
How cheap. He'll easily
listen to you for a melon.

589
00:44:21,392 --> 00:44:23,661
Ms. Daimon. He's here.

590
00:44:25,295 --> 00:44:26,130
He's here.

591
00:44:29,466 --> 00:44:30,334
Yes?

592
00:44:32,102 --> 00:44:37,708
I have brought a gift from the
legendary nurse, Ms. Masae Mihara.

593
00:44:38,275 --> 00:44:39,309
A gift?

594
00:44:39,877 --> 00:44:41,111
Here it is.

595
00:44:42,780 --> 00:44:45,416
What is it?

596
00:44:48,619 --> 00:44:50,087
It's a gratuity.

597
00:44:58,062 --> 00:44:59,063
What's this?

598
00:45:06,970 --> 00:45:09,773
Clothes that cover a large area.

599
00:45:11,475 --> 00:45:12,910
Such bad taste.

600
00:45:12,976 --> 00:45:14,878
- Try it on.
- It'll look good on you.

601
00:45:14,945 --> 00:45:18,215
No way. I won't wear it.

602
00:45:19,316 --> 00:45:25,456
<i>Surgeon Michiko Daimon,</i>
<i>also known as Doctor-X.</i>

603
00:45:31,095 --> 00:45:36,767
Soon you'll surely stand at the top
of the medical science in Japan.

604
00:45:40,104 --> 00:45:44,308
Judging from your fortune,
now's the best time.

605
00:45:45,709 --> 00:45:49,279
Will you promise me?

606
00:45:50,414 --> 00:45:51,515
Yes.

607
00:45:52,149 --> 00:45:53,917
When you make your move,

608
00:45:53,984 --> 00:45:57,654
the Japan Nurse's Federation
will give you full support.

609
00:46:02,326 --> 00:46:06,930
Thank you for such reassuring words.

610
00:46:10,400 --> 00:46:11,301
However...

611
00:46:13,203 --> 00:46:15,172
Michiko Daimon.

612
00:46:17,274 --> 00:46:19,843
Be careful with that woman.

613
00:46:25,082 --> 00:46:29,086
She might become a cancer for you one day.

614
00:46:31,555 --> 00:46:33,290
I am well aware.

615
00:46:48,939 --> 00:46:51,108
Can you operate at this hospital?

616
00:46:51,175 --> 00:46:53,377
We must win this battle.

617
00:46:53,443 --> 00:46:57,114
"My voice is my life.
My voice was taken away from me."

618
00:46:57,181 --> 00:46:58,382
Don't let the part-timer do it.

619
00:46:58,448 --> 00:46:59,750
Stop the camera.

620
00:46:59,817 --> 00:47:03,754
Dr. X is necessary evil.
